### Get all schemes
GET https://localhost:7178/api/v1/classify/schemes
Accept: application/json


### Create a new scheme
POST https://localhost:7178/api/v1/classify/schemes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "product-tags-3",
  "label": "Product Tags 3",
  "editable": true,
  "repeatable": true,
  "hierarchical": false,
  "sortable": true,
  "properties": "{}"
}


### Create another scheme (for sorting)
POST https://localhost:7178/api/v1/classify/schemes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "status-1",
  "label": "Workflow Status",
  "editable": false,
  "repeatable": false,
  "hierarchical": false,
  "sortable": true,
  "properties": "{\"color\":\"green\"}"
}


### Get a scheme by slug (new route style)
GET https://localhost:7178/api/v1/classify/schemes/slug/status
Accept: application/json


### Update an existing scheme (by ID is preferred now)
PUT https://localhost:7178/api/v1/classify/schemes/93873e85-8cd0-4712-981a-90ebbd9fcac6  // Replace {id} with actual GUID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "status",
  "label": "Workflow Status (Updated)",
  "editable": true,
  "repeatable": false,
  "hierarchical": false,
  "sortable": false,
  "properties": "{\"color\":\"blue\"}"
}


### Delete a scheme by ID
DELETE https://localhost:7178/api/v1/classify/schemes/93873e85-8cd0-4712-981a-90ebbd9fcac6  // Replace {id} with actual GUID
Accept: application/json


### Try to get deleted scheme by slug
GET https://localhost:7178/api/v1/classify/schemes/slug/status
Accept: application/json

### Missing required slug field
POST https://localhost:7178/api/v1/classify/schemes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "Missing Slug Test",
  "editable": true,
  "repeatable": true,
  "hierarchical": false,
  "sortable": true,
  "properties": "{}"
}

### Invalid JSON (syntax error)
POST https://localhost:7178/api/v1/classify/schemes
Content-Type: application/json

{

}

